d Air 11-inch simulator (iPadOS 27.2) at 375 and 511 pt and the full window; an iPhone 17 keeps its 62 pt; the tvOS build passes","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"vpnhood/VpnHood","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T02:42:39Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"1b986fe73735968a15fe69fcad891768b323cd2c","github_link":"https://github.com/vpnhood/VpnHood/commit/1b986fe73735968a15fe69fcad891768b323cd2c","commit_subject":"Android, a foldable: unfolding frees the app again. Folded, the activity locks itself upright as on a phone; unfolded, Android kept that lock by letterboxing it, and IsPhone, reading the letterbox's width from the activity's configuration (sw526dp), kept it upright for good. An activity is now measured by the largest window the display gives it (WindowManager.MaximumWindowMetrics, Android 11+). Tested on a Pixel Fold emulator (Android 15): fold, unfold, the unfolded screen turned, fold and unfold twice","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"Notifiarr/notifiarr","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T02:42:25Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"a57445d775580d1a3a986563a97e03d0377deedd","github_link":"https://github.com/Notifiarr/notifiarr/commit/a57445d775580d1a3a986563a97e03d0377deedd","commit_subject":"Make the Swedish skip wording unambiguous.","ai_tool":"Cursor"},{"repo_name":"lima-vm/lima","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T02:42:20Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"7b4194c7d20d699593684c9d06b679bdc4a470d9","github_link":"https://github.com/lima-vm/lima/commit/7b4194c7d20d699593684c9d06b679bdc4a470d9","commit_subject":"templates: update Alpine images","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"lima-vm/lima","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T02:42:20Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"16f006f849cdfd628d2762548b966dc73a069ac8","github_link":"https://github.com/lima-vm/lima/commit/16f006f849cdfd628d2762548b966dc73a069ac8","commit_subject":"Makefile: hold back alpine-3.23 and alpine-3.24 in update-templates","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"lima-vm/lima","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T02:42